    Commission levels are conventions described by property-portal guides, not rules. GST on a broker's commission is 18%, per a Razorpay guide of February 2025. Registration for GST on services is required above Rs 20 lakh of yearly turnover (Rs 10 lakh in some hill and north-eastern states) as of that guide. Confirm both on the GST portal.
  </p>

