    <div class="compare-card compare-card--teal">
      <div class="compare-card__label">Your habits</div>
      <ul>
        {scamCompare.teal.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--amber">
    <p>
      <strong>Cash and black money.</strong> Income tax law limits cash: an advance of Rs 20,000 or more for a property transfer and a receipt of Rs 2 lakh or more both fall under cash restrictions, with a penalty equal to the amount. These limits are described under the Income-tax Act, 1961, and the new Income-tax Act, 2025 has applied since 1 April 2026 with renumbered sections, so confirm the current section with a tax professional. A broker who arranges "part cash" is part of the story if the tax department asks. Refuse it, politely and every time.
    </p>
  </div>

